  {
    "ply": 9,
    "san": "a4",
    "comment": "Bogoljubov was considered a very good expert of\nthe Slave Defense. He had proved that the year before (1929) during his match\nagainst Alekhine. But Mikenas did not care about that. He had studied openings\nvery carefully, and the strategic ideas and right in the Slave he had a\nnovelty. Was not this a good opportunity to test it?",
    "nags": []
  },
