    "ply": 10,
    "san": "Bf5",
    "comment": "In the first\ngame of his match against Alekhine Bogo tried to have an edge with 5... e6 6.\ne4 Bb4 7. e5 Nd5 8. Bd2 Bxc3 9. bxc3 b5 but the World Champion reacted very\nactively: 10.Ng5 f6 11. exf6 Nxf6 12. Be2 obtaining a position with many\npossibilities of attack.",
